    "brief_description": "MMTEB (Massive Multilingual Text Embedding Benchmark) is a large-scale, community-driven expansion of MTEB, covering over 500 quality-controlled evaluation tasks across 10 task categories and 1051 languages (250+ excluding bitext mining), spanning diverse domains including fiction, social media, medical texts, and programming documentation. It constructs several sub-benchmarks including MTEB(Multilingual) with 132 tasks, MTEB(Europe) with 74 tasks, MTEB(Indic) with 23 tasks, and MTEB(eng, v2) with 41 tasks."
  },
